<mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>i</mtext></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>i</mtext><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>i</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>i</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>i</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>i</mtext><mi>q</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, to simplify the fraction on the left-hand side, we multiply the numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"152\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 12.175em;\"><mjx